   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- John Darnielle requested the redaction of this unreleased track from the recording files [1]\n- A listener inquired about the missing song and offered to trade private tapes [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Abide with Me**: back after 256 archived shows (5362 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Born Ready**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Pseudothyrum Song**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Cobscook Bay**: back after 76 archived shows (808 days) [4]\n- **The Last Limit of Bhakti**: back after 99 archived shows (1533 days); rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Same as Cash**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Attention All Pickpockets**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2023-11-24.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 86 min; rated 2.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2023-11-24.flac**: taped by Liz Hamilton; transferred by Liz Hamilton; source: Zoom H1 Handy Recorder [1]",
